  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "• Finely chop the garlic (or use a garlic press). Cut the carrot (unpeeled) into half-moons. Trim the green beans and slice into thirds. Roughly chop the capsicum. Zest the lime (see ingredients list) and cut into wedges.\n• Roughly chop the coriander.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/5f2a29457ff1dd1eeb42d867/step-0d82e332.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Cut the firm tofu into 2cm cubes. In a medium bowl combine the tofu, Southeast Asian spice blend, the salt and season with pepper. Toss to coat.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/5f2a29457ff1dd1eeb42d867/step-83e3e5ea.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Heat a good drizzle of olive oil in a large frying pan over a medium-high heat. Add the tofu and cook, turning, until browned all over, 3-4 minutes.\n• Transfer to a plate lined with a paper towel.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/5f2a29457ff1dd1eeb42d867/step-6b054938.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Return the frying pan to a medium-high heat with a drizzle of oil. Add the green beans, carrot and capsicum and cook until softened, 3-4 minutes. Add the garlic, lime zest and Thai red curry paste (see ingredients list) and cook until fragrant, 1 minute.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/5f2a29457ff1dd1eeb42d867/step-263d9958.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Add the coconut cream (see ingredients list), water, brown sugar, soy sauce and udon noodles to the veggies. Bring to the boil and then simmer until slightly thickened, 2 minutes. Stir through a squeeze of lime juice and remove from the heat.\n• TIP: Use a fork to separate the noodles.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/5f2a29457ff1dd1eeb42d867/step-8666b1c2.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Divide the coconut curry noodles between bowls and top with the tofu. Sprinkle over the coriander.\n• Serve with remaining lime wedges.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/5f2a29457ff1dd1eeb42d867/step-3ebaffca.jpg"
    }
  ]
